# PC card pc-modes-check (BENCH-246): HadurTeam built as @A@ (bb = master's copy, so = master with MOVE-43's shadow fix off) against master (aa) on all 46 census teams, 8 seeds from 7400. Template: mcprep writes work/modes-check-team-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
